  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": "1",
      "timing": "00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,942",
      "text": "TARIQ: Claude, GTA 6 comes out soon, and every influencer on my feed claims you can make twenty grand clipping live streams with AI. Is that actually real?"
    },
    {
      "index": "2",
      "timing": "00:00:10,122 --> 00:00:15,215",
      "text": "CLAUDE: Let us break it into three honest parts: what people claim, how to do it free, and the copyright reality."
    },
    {
      "index": "3",
      "timing": "00:00:15,396 --> 00:00:18,202",
      "text": "TARIQ: Start with the hype. What are they telling people to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": "4",
      "timing": "00:00:18,382 --> 00:00:25,583",
      "text": "CLAUDE: Take an eight-hour streamer broadcast, have an AI detect the funny moments, convert it to nine-by-sixteen, and spam it across TikTok and Reels."
    },
    {
      "index": "5",
      "timing": "00:00:25,763 --> 00:00:29,798",
      "text": "TARIQ: So literally just re-uploading other people's gameplay without editing?"
    },
    {
      "index": "6",
      "timing": "00:00:29,978 --> 00:00:31,907",
      "text": "CLAUDE: That is the entire business model."
    },
    {
      "index": "7",
      "timing": "00:00:32,087 --> 00:00:34,773",
      "text": "TARIQ: Okay, but how much does the AI software cost?"
    },
    {
      "index": "8",
      "timing": "00:00:34,953 --> 00:00:40,409",
      "text": "CLAUDE: Zero dollars. An open-source tool called OpenShorts just dropped on GitHub with eight thousand stars."
    },
    {
      "index": "9",
      "timing": "00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:42,088",
      "text": "TARIQ: Wait, it is completely free?"
    },
    {
      "index": "10",
      "timing": "00:00:42,268 --> 00:00:50,286",
      "text": "CLAUDE: MIT licensed. You paste any stream link, and local AI extracts viral clips, crops the facecam, and generates animated captions automatically."
    },
    {
      "index": "11",
      "timing": "00:00:50,466 --> 00:00:54,481",
      "text": "TARIQ: Wait, it handles face tracking and captions too? What am I supposed to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": "12",
      "timing": "00:00:54,661 --> 00:00:57,784",
      "text": "CLAUDE: Press publish and pray YouTube's algorithm does not notice."
    },
    {
      "index": "13",
      "timing": "00:00:57,965 --> 00:01:00,762",
      "text": "TARIQ: And that brings us to part three: is the money real?"
    },
    {
      "index": "14",
      "timing": "00:01:00,942 --> 00:01:07,981",
      "text": "CLAUDE: The views are real. But the footage belongs to Rockstar, and YouTube actively demonetizes reused content with zero commentary."
    },
    {
      "index": "15",
      "timing": "00:01:08,162 --> 00:01:12,435",
      "text": "TARIQ: Plus fifty thousand kids will be clipping the exact same stream on launch day."
    },
    {
      "index": "16",
      "timing": "00:01:12,614 --> 00:01:18,329",
      "text": "CLAUDE: Exactly. In a gold rush, the people getting rich are not the clippers, it is the developers building the clipping tools."
    },
    {
      "index": "17",
      "timing": "00:01:18,510 --> 00:01:22,349",
      "text": "TARIQ: So I should not quit my engineering job to farm GTA clips?"
    },
    {
      "index": "18",
      "timing": "00:01:22,530 --> 00:01:25,769",
      "text": "CLAUDE: You are a senior developer, Tariq. Go review your pull requests."
    },
    {
      "index": "19",
      "timing": "00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:26,641",
      "text": "TARIQ: Fair enough."
    }
  ]
}